Weighing the benefits of audio visual rental in Malaga? The real case for renting over buying comes down to three things: a fixed, known price instead of a large upfront purchase, no equipment to store or maintain between events, and a crew that delivers, sets up, tests and collects it, so nothing is your responsibility to run.

Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests every package across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear's rental packages start at 290 euros for the Eco Pack, with no equipment to buy, store or maintain between events. Backed by experience going back to 1996, we deliver, install and test the equipment, so your only job is to show up.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Key Highlights

---

Renting audio visual equipment has real, specific advantages over buying it.

-   A known, fixed price per event: our packages range from 290 euros (Eco Pack) to 650 euros (Wedding Pack), ex VAT.

-   No equipment to store, maintain or replace between events; you rent only for the event you have.

-   Delivery, installation and testing handled by our crew, so nothing arrives at your venue for you to figure out.

-   A technician included on the Wedding Pack and MICE Pack, and available as an add on elsewhere, for the events where something going wrong mid speech actually matters.

## The Real Cost Comparison

Buying a sound system, lighting rig and screen outright means a large upfront cost, plus storage and maintenance between uses. Renting means a fixed, known price per event instead: our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) starts at 290 euros, our [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) at 295 euros, our [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) at 310 euros, our [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) at 490 euros, and our [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) at 650 euros, all ex VAT with delivery, setup and teardown included. See full, live pricing on our [packages page](/packages/).

<InlineCTA />

## We Handle It, Start to Finish

Every package is delivered, installed and tested by our own crew, then collected again after your event. You never transport, set up or troubleshoot the equipment yourself. On the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), a technician also stays on site for the hours that matter, so a dropped microphone connection or a projector that will not sync gets fixed immediately, not during your event.

## Flexibility for Different Events

Renting means matching the equipment to the event instead of owning one fixed setup. A small private party fits the Eco Pack; a wedding ceremony fits the Wedding Pack's included technician and fairy-light ambiance; a corporate meeting or product launch fits the Product Presentation or Basic MICE Pack; a larger conference or gala fits the MICE Pack. See the full comparison on our [audio visual rental page](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

