## FAQs

### Is it cheaper to rent or buy AV equipment?

For most one-off or occasional events, renting is cheaper: our packages start at 290 euros, ex VAT, with delivery, setup and teardown included, versus a large upfront purchase plus storage and maintenance between uses.

### What is included in an AV rental price?

Delivery, professional setup, testing and teardown, on every package. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) also include a technician on site. See exact inclusions per package on our [packages page](/packages/).

### Do I need to store or maintain the equipment myself?

No. Our crew delivers the equipment before your event and collects it afterward, so you never store, transport or maintain it between events.

### Is a technician included, or do I run the equipment myself?

It depends on the package. The Wedding Pack and MICE Pack include a technician on site. On other packages, a technician is available as an add on, or the equipment is delivered ready to run yourself.

### How do I know which package fits my event?

It depends on the event type and guest count: an Eco Pack for a small private party, a Wedding Pack for a wedding, a Product Presentation or Basic MICE Pack for a corporate meeting, or a MICE Pack for a larger conference or gala. See [Flexibility for Different Events](#flexibility-for-different-events) above.

### How much does audio visual rental cost in Malaga?

Our packages range from 290 euros for the Eco Pack to 650 euros for the Wedding Pack, ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. See live pricing for every package on our [packages page](/packages/).

### How far in advance should I book audio visual rental?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
